
Analysis Description
--------------------
Fit one of the available codon models to the data, report fit results
and model estimates. Model specific options will differ. You can also
perform Likelihood Ratio Tests (LRT) on any model parameter by passing
--parameter_name value on the command line.

- __Requirements__: in-frame codon alignment and a phylogenetic tree

- __Written by__: Sergei L Kosakovsky Pond

- __Contact Information__: spond@temple.edu

- __Analysis Version__: 0.1


